Go simplifies processing json data with the encoding/json package. 

This example shows how to unmarshal some JSON into a struct:

```go
package main

import (
    "encoding/json"
    "fmt"
)

type User struct {
    Name string `json:"name"`
    Age  int    `json:"age"`
}

